{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "0f541e2c0ae35379e6048fe6b741a94cfe551a71d205d6031eda67c2c0a616b5", "ja": "ドキドキ☆水族館デート", "zh": "心跳不已☆水族馆约会", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e9401f231f0ee4a175929121e2d60b08ffc4c099d1a7d89788bfda2adc2eb8d6", "ja": "ウィルゴの3人との疑似デートで、午後は\n水族館へ。だが普通に水族館を楽しんでいる\n状況に、昴は疑問を抱く。静香はアドバイス\nをするようプロデューサーに求めるが、\nそんな中、イルカショーが始まる。", "zh": "跟『处女座』三人的模拟约会，\n下午的行程是参观水族馆。虽然大家都\n乐在其中，昴却对这种氛围抱有疑问。\n静香请制作人给昴一些建议，\n但碰巧海豚秀也即将开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f4c402a6f121b04b165a60f1cb6c9656814afb4a5e915470c64dd870079bab2", "ja": "（ウィルゴの3人は恋を研究するため、\n疑似デートを体験中……午後は水族館デートだ）", "zh": "（『处女座』的三人为了研究爱情，\n目前正在体验模拟约会……下午要到水族馆约会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4199363b2bbd97b1d4730953483a0b8a0c9ec956f72981a62ca0ae86498db2be", "ja": "（午前中は少し失敗してしまったからな……。\n気を引き締めていくぞ！）", "zh": "（上午有些地方搞砸了……\n接下来我可要绷紧神经！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "e0d093c2262f4804248c7b03c0e5d39ad888340c772369d439bb66fd7185cf89", "ja": "すっげー！　魚がたくさんいる！\nうわぁ、かっこいいなぁ……！", "zh": "真厉害──！有好多鱼！\n哇，好帅喔……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "3f256b31caa6acf0c74090b4e41ea66a2a44c49e58c8b6a69f48dbfb040d61a5", "ja": "キラキラしてて、幻想的……。\nお魚が、なんだか楽しそうに見えますね。ふふっ！", "zh": "闪闪发光的，真是梦幻……\n感觉鱼儿看起来很开心呢，呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "220196d9fddf6700485f75533e49ce7a5ea29fa35f06272f1f7f6e56db97bb97", "ja": "水族館って、ドキドキしますね。デートコースでは\n定番ですけど、普段あまり行かない場所というか……。", "zh": "来水族馆会让人心跳不已呢，虽然这是\n再常见不过的约会行程，但我们平常很少来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3c008550008c4b3b32854a9346e27a0694efbd560507dd885dd3bf6108afaadd", "ja": "言われてみればそうだな。ここは昴のリクエストで\n選んだんだけど……昴も、そう思って選んだのか？", "zh": "这么一说，确实是这样呢。这里是\n昴说要来的……昴，你也是因为这样想才选这里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "d7bb124035f2f7266de501a1bd977becee232e0841a913ec495d595db25a8ad9", "ja": "ううん。オレ、デートとかよくわかんなかったから……\n家で、兄ちゃんたちに聞いてみたんだ。", "zh": "不是的，我不太知道约会要做什么……\n所以我是跟家里的哥哥们问来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "95a829c18c1372cb6a3c468428e0944e5bf52429d94b1c46298a752fe97d998f", "ja": "そしたらみんな「デートはやっぱ水族館！」って！\nでも、「誰と行くんだ！」ってしつこくてさ～。", "zh": "他们都说约会就该去水族馆！\n但又一直追问我要跟谁去，烦死了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "c6a8bade1978248282613da69986e9b039cfbb99309f8960e09466bd13d50dd7", "ja": "劇場のみんなとだって言ったらいなくなったけど、\nなんだったんだろ？　……あ、タコ！　すっげー速い！", "zh": "我回答说是跟剧场的人去，他们就不烦我了，\n到底是怎样啊……啊，是章鱼！游得好快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "925c501e2c7213eeb2dbc84894190afaa28466081ca48169738eea07e717e1ea", "ja": "なるほど……。うん、いいアドバイスをもらったな。\nよし、それじゃあ早速、みんなで回ってみよう！", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，他们给的建议不错呢。\n好，我们就赶紧到处参观吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "7a8197c52ef8afe44f3dc6074c147ecf9904151ef0ba930393e2894de0988a5f", "ja": "すごかった～！　タコ、すっげー墨吐いてたな！\nなあなあ、{$P$}も見た！？", "zh": "好壮观喔～！章鱼吐了超多墨汁出来耶！\n欸欸，{$P$}有看到吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "abbfe7975fb2f404d6c5c681cb04ef125c8406ab0a3dcfe8cf4b6d0815be3e27", "ja": "ああ、見たよ。すごくウネウネしてたし、\n水の中の墨ってあんな風になるんだな……。", "zh": "嗯，有看到。\n章鱼一直扭来扭去，而且原来墨汁在水中是像那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "0a250b490ab32860b2434c681adb660b07329c877700e2e3d6de34b9c1dce39b", "ja": "えへへ。オレ、タコって好きなんだ～。\nあ、そういえばカニもいたな？　カニもいいよな～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我很喜欢章鱼呢～\n啊，那边也有螃蟹对吧，螃蟹也很棒呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "d0637f13eca791670c8073a30b429d48de8e7262ad904087fc308f558834c164", "ja": "オレ、特にタラバが好きなんだ！\nあと、マグロ！　マグロも泳いでた！", "zh": "我特别喜欢帝王蟹！\n还有鲔鱼！鲔鱼也在水里游呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "aa62da37a5dea08c74eff499a59dddbb1360ebd234663749fa2294374c0757e4", "ja": "かっこいいよなー、マグロ。すっげーうまいし。\nオレ、やっぱマグロが一番好き！", "zh": "鲔鱼好帅喔～而且又超好吃的。\n我果然还是最喜欢鲔鱼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c504ced521a1602653af1bcd9c556da2cb619cb775bb9ab054035bb47fb98d2a", "ja": "昴、海の生き物が好きだったんだな……。\nなんだか意外な気がするよ。", "zh": "原来昴这么喜欢海洋生物啊……\n感觉有点意外呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "329f07dc01090ff4f9bf607e74a53839e63aca0c7a17759c954c296d201aa828", "ja": "え、そうかな？　意外？", "zh": "咦，是吗？觉得意外？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "dff168894dfde51ca17960dda011ce920c9db3b61610ca050ee4acb946191964", "ja": "そういえば……うん、新鮮かも。私も、\n昴さんがお魚を好きだなんて、知らなかったし。", "zh": "这么说起来……嗯，或许挺新鲜的。\n我也是头一次知道昴喜欢鱼类。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "0467762e36a101cfdd4fcc6faa8138e16433960fbccab48bd2da832fb8659e67", "ja": "劇場では、アイドルについてとか、学校について\n話すことが多いから。たしかに、あまりないかも……。", "zh": "在剧场时，聊天话题大多跟偶像或学校有关，\n确实很少提到这方面的样子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "77b04e2fa5c80bc5ef6f98b69897784830a0b620180e0f706c18e288982f867e", "ja": "オレ、魚とかって大好きだよ。なんかみんな\nがんばってる感じで。あとうまいし！", "zh": "我超喜欢鱼类那些生物喔，感觉每一只\n都活得很卖力，而且很好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7e81d5388b33c4a155e56ec2e8104103bd00b03f697236b68227a11ba0cd6ce3", "ja": "そうか……。じゃあ今度、\nみんなで回転ずしとかにも行きたいな！", "zh": "这样啊……\n那下次大家一起去吃回转寿司好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "574fb6bc62de382474b9338a760bd90962c8f1140607a7e6de40cd2558724fc4", "ja": "ほんと！？　やったー！　マグロも食べていい！？\n……って、んん？　なあ、{$P$}。", "zh": "真的吗！？耶──！可以吃鲔鱼吗！？\n……咦，嗯嗯？欸，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "fb3a152d8f5acf56fdc7a24c912d581233aa83138d192f54ea16ac61943e89aa", "ja": "デートって、こういうのでいいのかな。\nなんか、ちょっと違うような気がしない？", "zh": "这样真的算是约会吗？\n你不觉得好像不太对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "cfba41334f104963d5b731eeaf433e9743d20f9b333895941702bb52988dac01", "ja": "そ、そうか？", "zh": "会、会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "c83856d903c5463796a24c3021b4d64c155d1a5cb5c75a99af7fc16be23b6303", "ja": "そうだよ！　だって魚がうまそうみたいな話しか\nしてないし！　それって、恋の話とかじゃないじゃん！", "zh": "会啊！我们只是在聊海鲜很好吃而已！\n这跟爱情根本无关嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1025_047sub", "source_sha256": "6f9d6944b1acc889f8e9f3ef6657d59987e0c2951d3084ddbca8a0e3afeda4cd", "ja": "うう、どうしたらデートになるんだろう……。\nねえどうしよう、{$P$}！", "zh": "呜呜，要怎么做才会有约会的样子……\n你说要怎么办啦，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "88e93f41dc8e6833fb4591dc452b8c1412b6bbd06949492f2ec216bc043f4ec1", "ja": "{$P$}！\n昴に、何かアドバイスしてあげてください！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n请给昴一些建议吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "0b539dcad8993ea18fd02cbdf10ba88e1de27d134d994bea1afc10230deeff05", "ja": "ええと、そうだな……。", "zh": "我想想，这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1028_announce", "source_sha256": "141a349fdc0e224d5d08a19da00411a546e37f74650cb1b08197bd304706d0f1", "ja": "ピンポンパンポーン♪\n間もなく、イルカショーの開催時間です。", "zh": "叮咚当咚──♪\n各位来宾，海豚秀即将开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1029_026yur", "source_sha256": "d39f763bd1e9af47258aafa896a77557a94a060596a9fd04f7b3955fccbb61e1", "ja": "あ、イルカショーが始まるみたいですよ！\n私、見たいです！", "zh": "啊，海豚秀好像要开始了！\n我想去看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "a67c05f436080217dc8cea94fdf0f9b154190bd4af8eb5d22392e2a57d1b9ff5", "ja": "え？　マジ！？　イルカショー？\n見たい！　行こうぜ{$P$}！", "zh": "咦？真的假的！？海豚秀？\n我想看！快走吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "470349c16eb679bc14bed71642cbfddf1eeb7c806aaad880e3b264f433f869fe", "ja": "水族館デートと言えば、イルカショーだよな。\nデートっぽいし……よし、行ってみよう！", "zh": "到水族馆约会，当然要看海豚秀。\n这样也有几分约会的感觉……好，我们去瞧瞧吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1033_047sub", "source_sha256": "e7424ca616d67295743d8ffb646db0326f8a2e8b58fc09115362d7ec09ddf980", "ja": "{$P$}、静香、百合子！\nせっかくだから、前の方で見ようよ！", "zh": "{$P$}、静香、百合子！\n我们难得过来，就到前面一点看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
