{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "6404885b8907e75620b753d63812c91cb9d090de8060d911869a3b6a42dc70af", "ja": "うう、冷た……くない……？\nえ？　{$P$}？", "zh": "呜呜，好……不冷……？\n咦？{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "9f26f8ab558ce28ee78aaf75e672be7c62798c51262791fcfc20892100aba270", "ja": "大丈夫か？　昴！\nふう、危うくびしょびしょになるところだったな！", "zh": "没事吧？昴！\n呼，你差点被喷湿了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1044_047sub", "source_sha256": "f1087b9a9877dc158b2f2d6eb587b7c5c05c329155ea8488dc0b2a5c80f59720", "ja": "お、オレは大丈夫だけど……{$P$}が\nびしょ濡れじゃんか！　ハンカチあるから拭いてよ！", "zh": "我、我是没怎样啦……但{$P$}\n都湿透了耶！我有带手帕，你快拿去擦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "5f5d8fef8aa5a3c2c91440d6ed0c8f861c64d9a90d061d14b6f422fb572faa34", "ja": "お、ありがとう。\n昴は濡れてるところないか？", "zh": "喔，谢啦。\n昴有哪里被喷到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1046_047sub", "source_sha256": "991df4589da2d703c9fadf01f53292a8725f378711e38646da6d779969f453e0", "ja": "う、うん。{$P$}が\nかばってくれたから……。", "zh": "没、没有，因为{$P$}\n都帮我挡下来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1047_026yur", "source_sha256": "7c08e8144bfe23a289733285a5cb2bd97fe69f6a332d3fdf8eaa586d46f345c6", "ja": "イルカも、昴さんが楽しそうにしてたから、\nテンションが上がってしまったんでしょうか。", "zh": "我想海豚也是因为看到昴那么开心，\n所以才不小心兴奋过头了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "3c0ac4ba05ce3952b2295660aac01490bc53f47ae74ffdff4b10337483b3c3f8", "ja": "ふふっ、そうかも。\nでも濡れなくてよかったわね、昴。", "zh": "呵呵，或许是呢。\n不过昴没被喷湿，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1049_047sub", "source_sha256": "bee01a00f78b106abcb68c7281020fc4c14e25b7033335e7cc4381bb25cc9f6a", "ja": "うん……。\nていうか、あれ……？", "zh": "嗯……\n是说，奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1050_015siz", "source_sha256": "79b0130c7da66d8574e216e13d932bccf770f8dfc48d4ae2fda77e0f65d3d07f", "ja": "昴？　どうかしたの？", "zh": "昴，你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_05_1051_047sub", "source_sha256": "a01e617fc4badb40872eadf87f494405b100ee34ee852541f26fbcc7c8aa7e04", "ja": "なんか……。今オレ、変な感じが……なんだ、これ？\nもしかして、これが「キュン」ってやつ……？", "zh": "我现在……好像有种奇怪的感觉……这是什么？\n难道这就是所谓的「心动」……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
